---

@BEGIN title="双人同行"

@ACT id=1 title="并肩前行"

@SCENE id=plaza time=evening weather=clear

@CAST actor=mira
@CAST actor=old_chen

@SPAWN_PROP prop=lamp_post id=lamp_1 at=(28, 22) state=on
@SPAWN_PROP prop=lamp_post id=lamp_2 at=(34, 28) state=on

@ENTER actor=mira at=(28, 22) facing=east
@ENTER actor=old_chen at=(30, 22) facing=east

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「陈伯，我们一起去那边坐坐吧。」
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2
「好，慢慢走。」
@END

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to=(34, 28) speed=1.2
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to=(36, 28) speed=1.2
@END

@FACE actor=mira facing=north
@FACE actor=old_chen facing=north

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「到了，这儿的晚风真舒服。」
@END

@NARRATION duration=2
两个人在广场边并肩坐下，夜色渐渐柔和。

@END_SCRIPT
